{{Term/Store|Stealth Chest Guard|Stealth Chest Guards|Series, BotW|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/> Stealth Chest Guards go unnamed in {{SSBU}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Stealth Chest Guard is a piece of [[Armor]] which can be purchased at [[Enchanted]] in [[Kakariko Village]]. According to its description, the [[Sheikah]] fabrics used to make the Chest Guard suppress the rustling of clothes.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When worn, it provides one level of [[Stealth Up]]. The Stealth Chest Guard can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Stealth Chest Guard, alongside the [[Stealth Mask]] and [[Stealth Tights]], compose the [[Stealth Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides the [[Night Speed Up]] [[Set Bonus]].

